00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:51,000
A small mundane coastal town, home to the beau-monde.

4
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:06,000
To compete with Venice and Cannes, the posh casino hosts the second ‘World Festival of Film
and the Arts’ in 1949, organised in part by the Royal Cinematheque of Belgium.

5
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:21,000
To celebrate cinema’s 50 year existence, they put together a side program showcasing the medium in all its shapes and forms: surrealist film, absolute film, dadaist films, abstract
film,… The side program would soon become a festival in its own right: ‘EXPRMNTL’, dedicated to experimental cinema, and would become a mythical gathering of the avant-garde…

